{"unit_id":"conafun__dsh-music-plus#card-zh","repo":"conafun/dsh-music-plus","commit":"aeb6c74ffa2e26e18da668cc247fd75796a8b3e0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-music-plus 是面向 DSH 网页端的本地音乐、播客和网络电台播放器。它由 Host 端扫描所选音乐目录并提供支持 Range 的音频路由，浏览器端在聊天区加入播放条和播放面板，同时注册 music_play_plus 工具，让 agent 按歌曲名、歌单名、电台名或风格请求播放。用户可以创建歌单、收藏曲目、订阅 RSS/Atom 播客并播放单集，也可浏览内置电台、导入电台源、搜索和收藏电台；播放器支持断点续播、播放模式和频谱显示。适合在 DSH 中管理本地音乐并集中收听播客或电台。无需 API 密钥；本地音乐可离线使用，播客和外部电台功能需要访问相应源站。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:2038-2045","lib/index.js:2040-2045","lib/podcast.js:1-18","lib/radio-host.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"conafun__dsh-music-plus#card-en","repo":"conafun/dsh-music-plus","commit":"aeb6c74ffa2e26e18da668cc247fd75796a8b3e0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-music-plus is a DSH web player for local music, podcasts, and internet radio. It adds a playback bar and panel, scans a music folder, manages playlists, parses RSS/Atom feeds, and lets the music_play_plus tool request tracks or stations. No API key is required; local music can play offline.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:2038-2045","lib/podcast.js:1-18","lib/radio-host.js:1-20"]}
