{"unit_id":"conafun__dsh-music-plus#caveat-1","repo":"conafun/dsh-music-plus","commit":"aeb6c74ffa2e26e18da668cc247fd75796a8b3e0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-music-plus 使用前须知：播客订阅会由 Host 请求用户填写的 feed 地址，并播放 feed 中的单集音频；使用这些功能需要网络可达相应站点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1375-1390","lib/index.js:1807-1824"]}
